# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# IDE-specific SKILL folders — 15+ near-duplicate copies across different editors.
# These are workspace-local IDE metadata (same class as .vscode/), NOT project
# source. If your particular IDE needs them, re-download via the IDE's skill
# installer or keep a local uncommitted copy.
#
# KEEP: .github/   (real project asset — holds CI workflows and prompt templates)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
